<div class="section">
<div class="section-header">PAEFOR Profile Overview</div>
<div class="section-content">
The PAEFOR Profile outlines detainee eligibility, supervision requirements, and financial obligations associated with pretrial release and program placement.
</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
<div class="section-header">Eligibility & Requirements</div>
<div class="section-content">

<div class="box">
• Must meet pretrial release eligibility criteria<br>
• Subject to supervision and compliance monitoring<br>
• Program assignment based on case evaluation<br>
• Identity verification required for all financial actions
</div>

<div class="box">
• Guarantor assumes financial responsibility<br>
• Payment completion required prior to release<br>
• Casefile credentials must be accurate and verified
</div>

</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
<div class="section-header">Example Casefiles (Reference Only)</div>
<div class="section-content">

<div class="box">
<strong>Casefile #OKC-24031</strong><br>
Client: D. Harris<br>
Charge Type: DUI / Traffic Offense<br>
Assigned Program: SOBER-STEP®™<br>
Supervision Level: Moderate<br>
Financial Requirement: $845.00<br>
Status: Eligible for Release Pending Payment
</div>

<div class="box">
<strong>Casefile #OKC-19844</strong><br>
Client: R. Thompson<br>
Charge Type: Domestic Disturbance<br>
Assigned Program: SAFER®™<br>
Supervision Level: Structured<br>
Financial Requirement: $1,017.00<br>
Status: Conditional Release Approval
</div>

<div class="box">
<strong>Casefile #OKC-30122</strong><br>
Client: M. Alvarez<br>
Charge Type: Substance Possession<br>
