Assigned Program: RARE-COVA©™<br>
Supervision Level: Intensive<br>
Financial Requirement: $1,599.00<br>
Status: Under Review for Eligibility
</div>

</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
<div class="section-header">Important Notice</div>
<div class="section-content">
All casefiles displayed are examples for informational purposes only. Actual case determinations are conducted by authorized pretrial officers and subject to court authority.
</div>
